MODULE: CutoverMatchesPhaseRevertAliasUnchanged
TARGET: CutoverMatchesPhase
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: revert advances to redirect fixup without moving the alias back
PERTURBS: RevertSwap

--- FIND
    /\ alias' = source /\ phase' = "redirect"
--- REPLACE
    /\ alias' = alias /\ phase' = "redirect"
--- END
